      "en_US": [
        "We, Team Galactic, are conducting\n",
        "research in the Eterna Forest!\r",
        "This is as far as you will go!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0928_SR205A_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Our research involves catching\n",
        "Pokémon in the flowery meadows of\\fFloaroma Town.\r",
